From: PiSight developers <pisight@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] usb: dwc2: guard current-frame recovery from old incomplete events

A delayed global incomplete-IN event can select a current-frame request
before that frame's EOPF. Acknowledge first, bound the acknowledgment and
decision times, and leave that request enabled when the event is provably
old. Preserve later EOPF events and track request identity for recovery
across frame-counter wrap. Diagnostic arm/timing state from patch0007 is
required by this correction. Hardware performance remains unverified.

---

